SUMMARY:Cougar Run 2025
DESCRIPTION:On September 25th\, students will take part in the Cougar Run\, a fun run event to help raise money for SCS! Pledge Packets have been sent home by backpack mail with instructions. Learn more about the event\, make your donation\, and find other resources here.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/cougar-run-2025/
CATEGORIES:School Events
